        "type": "core/prose",
        "data": {
          "html": "<p>We&apos;re a small studio building things that last. Our websites don&apos;t have a database. They don&apos;t run server code. They&apos;re files on a CDN &#x2014; and they&apos;ll keep working until the sun burns out.</p>",
          "max_width": "normal"
        }
      },
      {
